  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "Passive: start hidden recovering energy; Active: heal ally, grant rule immunity, ally converts HP to shield",
    "skill1": "Passive: penalize units causing large HP or shield loss; Active: heal weakest allies and reduce high-damage enemies' ATK",
    "skill2": "penalize ultimate casters by reducing energy recovery",
    "skill3": "violations permanently stack ATK and energy reduction",
    "skill4": "repeated violations lead to permanent silence and increased HP-loss, bypassing unaffected",
    "skill5": "violations trigger stun or silence based on rule type"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Contess]] starts **hidden while recovering Energy**, then emerges to heal an ally, grant rule immunity, and convert their HP into a shield. She punishes large HP or shield loss, heals the weakest allies, and cuts the ATK of high-damage enemies. She also slows ultimate casters' Energy recovery and stacks permanent ATK and Energy penalties on repeat violations. Severe violations can trigger permanent Silence and stronger HP-loss effects. She needs long fights to cycle rules and punishments, and is untargetable while hidden.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Contess]] stays hidden and untargetable at fight start, then emerges to shield her top damage dealer with Exemption and punish heavy hits with ATK and Energy penalties. Do not try to burst her while hidden or feed repeated violations into her silence rules. Once she emerges, priority-delete the Exemption carry with [[filter:backline-assassin]] like [[Ravion]] or [[Himmel]], or use lasting coverage like [[Shemira]] with [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Bonnie]]. The actionable window is after emergence, not during her hidden phase."
}